{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45034","headline":"和李舍人使君纾题云明府道室 · 皎然","name":"和李舍人使君纾题云明府道室","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"许令如今道姓云，曾经西岳事桐君。\n流霞手把应怜寿，黄鹤心期拟作羣。\n金籙时教弟子检，砂牀不遣世人闻。\n桂阳亦是神仙守，分别无嗟两地分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}